        예시:
        <suppress>
            <notes>개발용 라이브러리로 운영 환경에 미포함</notes>
            <gav regex="true">.*:spring-boot-devtools:.*</gav>
            <cve>CVE-2024-XXXXX</cve>
        </suppress>
    -->
</suppressions>
